<title>FINLAND: RAUMA JAN-AUG PROFIT RISES 16 PCT.</title>
<headline>RAUMA JAN-AUG PROFIT RISES 16 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items, tax  427 vs 369</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		5.70 vs 5.27</p>
<p> Net sales				     6,377 vs 6,043</p>
<p> Operating profit				453 vs 423</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts median forecast was for a 485 million markka</p>
<p>profit after financial items (mean 482 million). Forecasts</p>
